{"id": "86364", "name": "Vectors_add columns", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Evaluate the following expression:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left( ({{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}}){{CT:2}} - {{CT:3}} {{CT:4}}\\right) + {{CT:5}} {{CT:6}}.\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: each entry in its own box: a number, a fraction (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) or an expression (e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> First simplify the scalar coefficient in the brackets, then multiply each vector by its scalar (every component is multiplied), and finally add and subtract the resulting vectors component by component.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The scalar coefficient</b><br>Inside the brackets the first coefficient is a difference of two numbers:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}}={{CT:7}}, \\]</p>so the expression is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left({{CT:7}}{{CT:2}} - {{CT:3}} {{CT:4}}\\right) + {{CT:5}} {{CT:6}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Multiplying the vectors by the scalars</b><br>A scalar multiplies every component of the vector:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:7}}{{CT:2}}={{CT:8}},\\qquad {{CT:3}} {{CT:4}}={{CT:9}},\\qquad {{CT:5}} {{CT:6}}={{CT:10}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Adding the vectors</b><br>Vectors are added and subtracted component by component:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left( {{CT:8}} - {{CT:9}}\\right) + {{CT:10}} = {{CT:11}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c1", "c2", "c3", "correctanswer", "n1", "n2", "n3", "n4"], "nvariants": 50}